      mountain spur with a triangular layout, the northern and higher area
      holding the palace and the temples of [[ Ashur | ashur-god ]], [[ Anu
      ]], [[ Adad ]], [[ Sin | sin-mythology ]], [[ Shamash ]], and [[ Ishtar
      ]].[[ ^3 ]]
